      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "The SDK may have had a bug with it, but did that affect the client? The original issue doesn't indicate either way.\n\nThe server analysis system (which is displayed in the client) is the \"authority\" on performance stats, not the SDK.\n\nEither way: We don't have plans to increase the polygon -- sorry, *triangle* limit any time soon.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
