      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5acad9ecc9dba010c9c3ec68|full_name} The client behavior did change - legacy avatars that were previously not very poor are now very poor, and we think it's due to this bugfix.\n\nI'm disappointed that the triangle limits aren't being reconsidered, but I understand.\n\nWhat do you mean by \"polygon -- sorry, triangle limit\"? I'm not sure I understand this choice of words.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
