  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2026-01-11T19:29:01.882Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "There was an oversight that was recently fixed, wherein the \"Keep Quads\" option in Unity was causing the SDK to incorrectly report the actual number of triangles.\n\nfeedback.vrchat.com/sdk-bug-reports/p/using-keep-quads-option-in-mesh-import-settings-can-trick-sdk-triangle-count\n\nTo keep equal performance representation, the triangle count limits should be roughly doubled, as people have been unwittingly using this setting for a long time without understanding the implications on triangle count, and that's what the current performance rank numbers were considered around.",
